Here's how you can modify your code to handle this change:

Before (using callback):
```javascript
newWord.save((mongoError) => {
  if (mongoError) {
    console.error('Error inserting document into MongoDB:', mongoError);
  } else {
    console.log('Document inserted into MongoDB:', newWord);
  }
});
```

After (using promise):
```javascript
newWord.save()
  .then((result) => {
    console.log('Document inserted into MongoDB:', result);
  })
  .catch((error) => {
    console.error('Error inserting document into MongoDB:', error);
  });
```

