   ```tsx
   components={{
     code({ node, inline, className, children, ...props }: any) {
       ...
     },
   }}
   ```

2. **Why Use `any`?**
   - The type definitions of `ReactMarkdown` do not have a detailed type for the `components` prop, and the dynamic nature of the `code` property makes it tricky to type precisely.

